<title>SAUDI ARABIA: Saudi beheads Pakistani for drug smuggling.</title>
<headline>Saudi beheads Pakistani for drug smuggling.</headline>
<dateline>RIYADH 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia on Monday beheaded a Pakistani man for drug smuggling, raising to 42 the number of people put to death by the sword in the conservative kingdom this year.</p>
<p>An Information Ministry official said the man was beheaded in a square near Riyadh's main mosque.</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia enforces Islamic sharia law by publicly beheading convicted murderers, drug smugglers and rapists.</p>
</text>
